    C0 (IN GND) capacitor c=0.012674929279282805p 
ends ts_c_p_neg_1 
subckt tc_stage_2 GND IN OUT 
    G0 (OUT GND IN GND) vccs gm=0.7128474651050125m 
    R0 (OUT GND) resistor r=0.08416947935861868M 
    C0 (IN GND) capacitor c=0.5675537142555832p 
